  formalization_extracted_procedure
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "A formalization extracted at least two ordered imperative steps from attributed text."
    effect "Report the ordered steps and attribution while marking execution as unverified."
    unit "count"
    example "Three attributed steps were extracted; execution remains unverified."
    grounding "src/formalization/procedures.rs::ExtractedProcedure::from_step_records"
