  formalization_depth_exhausted
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "A recursive gloss raised a need beyond the declared concept-depth bound."
    effect "Name the reached bound and unresolved surface; never present bounded work as complete."
    unit "count"
    example "Depth 2 reached; one recursive need remains unresolved."
    grounding "src/formalization/needs.rs::satisfy"
