  formalization_offline_need
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "Live retrieval is disabled and no committed capture grounds a formalization need."
    effect "State the offline boundary and every source outcome without inventing evidence."
    unit "count"
    example "The need remains unresolved offline because no capture answered it."
    grounding "src/source_walk.rs::observe_failure"
